pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">학기 교내 성적우수 및 성적오름장학생 선발을 위한 외국어성적표 제출방법을 아래와 같이 안내하오니 </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:#ff0000;\">기한 내에 제출</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">▷ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">제출 대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">현재 재학생으로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2022-2</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">학기 성적 이수 예정자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, 2023</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">월 졸업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">수료</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">예정자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">수업연한초과자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">졸업유예자 제외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">▷ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">외국어시험성적 적용기준 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#ff0000;\">2021. 12. 1. ~ 2022. 11. 30.</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:#ff0000;\">까지 취득한 성적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#ff0000;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:#ff0000;\">응시일자 기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#ff0000;\">) </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">- (</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">외국어 성적 입력 및 성적표 제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">업로드</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">2022. 12. 30.(</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">)</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">까지</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">*</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">기한엄수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">*</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">    </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">우리대학 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#0000ff;\">‘BISKIT’</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:#0000ff;\">에 입력 및 제출</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">되어야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">    </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">공인외국어시험 및 국제교류교육원에서 실시하는 모의토익</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">모의토익스피킹 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">모두인정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">    </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">국제교류교육원에서 실시하는 모의토익</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">모의토익스피킹 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">성적은 국제교류교육원에서 일괄 등록하므로 학생이 별도로 입력 및 제출하지 않아도 됨 하지만</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:#0000ff;\">본인의 성적이 우리대학 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#0000ff;\">‘BISKIT’</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:#0000ff;\">에 제대로 입력되어 있는지 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#0000ff;\">\"</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:#0000ff;\">기한 내에</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#0000ff;\">\"  \"</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:#0000ff;\">학생본인이</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#0000ff;\">\" “</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:#0000ff;\">반드시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#0000ff;\">” </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:#0000ff;\">확인</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">하여야 함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">모의토익 성적이 제대로 반영되어 있지 않거나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">모의토익 문의는 어학상담실 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">478-7959, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">국제교류교육원 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">478-7216</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">로 문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">    </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">교내 성적장학생은 외국어성적을 취득하여야 함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:#ff0000;\">외국어시험성적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#ff0000;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:#ff0000;\">토익기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#ff0000;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:#ff0000;\">을 제출하지 않을 경우 성적장학생 선발에서 제외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#ff0000;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:#ff0000;\">외국어시험성적은 장학선발의 기본자격이며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#ff0000;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:#ff0000;\">자격충족자 중 우수자 선발</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">    </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:#0000ff;\">등록학기 기준으로 기준이 적용</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">되오니 착오없으시기 바람  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">ex) 1-2</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">학기 성적으로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2-1</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">학기 등록시 장학생으로 선정되기 위해서는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">학년 외국어성적기준을 충족해야 함 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">학부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">승인완료 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">:</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">2023. 1. 10.(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\">까지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">* </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">학과 연락처 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">붙임</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">▷ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">제출 방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">붙임 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">외국어성적 입력 방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">’ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">참고 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">붙임  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">1. 2023-1 </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">교내 성적장학생 선발관련 외국어성적표 제출 안내</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">      </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">외국어성적입력방법</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">      </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">3. </span><span s